title Vinyl: scrubbing the seek bar at 480x320 and 320x480 while paused (a finger held at three quarters: 03:03), then a real drag along the bar and its release (the seek; it stays paused)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 610
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE paused
env VINYL_DEMO_SCRUB 0.75

wait 1200
shot 01-scrubbing
expect esc
expect text "03:03"
expect text "-1:01"
@480x320 drag 0.20 0.731 0.80 0.731
@320x480 drag 0.25 0.717 0.75 0.717
wait 600
shot 02-after-drag
expect noquit
